===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/liːʃməˈnaɪəsɪs/|/laɪʃməˈnaɪəsɪs/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|leishmaniases}}

# {{pathology}} Any of various [[ulcerative]] skin diseases caused by any of the [[protozoa]]ns of the genus ''[[Leishmania]]'', transmitted to humans and animals by bloodsucking [[sandfly|sandflies]].

